#: setup/qml/Main.qml:300
msgid ""
"Monet downloads itself and Windows while it installs. Windows will use this network too."
msgstr ""
"Monet downloader sig selv og Windows under installationen. Windows bruger også dette netværk."

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:309
msgid "Connected with a cable"
msgstr "Forbundet med kabel"

#: setup/qml/Main.qml:340
msgctxt "a Wi-Fi network anyone can join, without a password"
